<title>POLAND: POLISH C.BANK BROAD MONEY, C/A DATA DUE WEDNESDAY.</title>
<headline>POLISH C.BANK BROAD MONEY, C/A DATA DUE WEDNESDAY.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland (NBP) is likely to release October broad money and September current account data on Wednesday, the NBP press office said.</p>
<p>Broad money supply figures for October were initially scheduled by the NBP to be released on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
